{
  "note": "条件求值（execution-state.evaluateCondition）：只有三种能求值，其余一律 unsupported 并挡住它保护的动作——不静默放行。这里也是 F2 的现场：current_scope 的第四种 disposition 没人认。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "scope-allows-when-the-scope-proceeds",
      "clauses": ["C.rules.16"],
      "authority": { "clause": "C.rules.16" },
      "kind": "conditions",
      "condition": { "kind": "scope_allows" },
      "context": {
        "intent": { "task_id": "t1" },
        "ir": { "t1": { "current_scope": { "disposition": "proceed" } } }
      },
      "expect": "satisfied"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope-does-not-allow-when-the-scope-is-paused",
      "clauses": ["D.521"],
      "authority": { "clause": "D.521" },
      "kind": "conditions",
      "condition": { "kind": "scope_allows" },
      "context": {
        "intent": { "task_id": "t1" },
        "ir": { "t1": { "current_scope": { "disposition": "paused" } } }
      },
      "expect": "unsatisfied"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope-does-not-allow-when-the-scope-is-withdrawn",
      "clauses": ["D.521"],
      "authority": { "clause": "D.521" },
      "kind": "conditions",
      "condition": { "kind": "scope_allows" },
      "context": {
        "intent": { "task_id": "t1" },
        "ir": { "t1": { "current_scope": { "disposition": "withdrawn" } } }
      },
      "expect": "unsatisfied"
    },
    {
      "id": "conditional-scope-cannot-be-evaluated",
      "clauses": ["D.337"],
      "known_issue": "F2",
      "authority": { "behaviour": "current", "fact": "F2" },
      "kind": "conditions",
      "why": "IR 的类型与合同都写着 disposition 有第四种 conditional，求值器只认三种，于是它保护的动作永远被挡",
      "condition": { "kind": "scope_allows" },
      "context": {
        "intent": { "task_id": "t1" },
        "ir": { "t1": { "current_scope": { "disposition": "conditional" } } }
      },
      "expect": "unsupported"
    },
    {
